sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant CloudRun as Cloud Run<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant Express as Express Backend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GIQ as GKE Recommender<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GitHubOAuth as GitHub OAuth<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GitHubAPI as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Browser,GitHubAPI: Flow 1: Benchmark Data Visualization

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET / (static assets)<br/>HTTPS, TLS 1.2+
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080 (internal)
    Express-->>CloudRun: React SPA + injected runtime config
    CloudRun-->>Browser: HTML/JS/CSS

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET /api/gcs/llm-d-benchmarks/...<br/>HTTPS, TLS 1.2+
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080
    Express->>Express: Bucket-boundary check<br/>Validate bucket in allowlist
    Express->>GCS: GET object<br/>HTTPS/443, ADC Bearer token
    GCS-->>Express: Benchmark data (JSON/YAML)
    Express-->>CloudRun: Parsed benchmark data
    CloudRun-->>Browser: JSON response

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET /api/giq/...<br/>HTTPS, Bearer token passthrough
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward request
    Express->>GIQ: GET inference profiles<br/>HTTPS/443, ADC Bearer token
    GIQ-->>Express: Performance/cost data
    Express-->>CloudRun: Proxied response
    CloudRun-->>Browser: GIQ data

    Note over Browser,GitHubAPI: Flow 2: GitHub OAuth Authentication

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET /api/auth/github/login<br/>HTTPS
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward
    Express-->>Browser: 302 Redirect to github.com/login/oauth/authorize<br/>client_id, scope=read:user

    Browser->>GitHubOAuth: GET /login/oauth/authorize<br/>HTTPS/443
    GitHubOAuth-->>Browser: Login page → authorize → redirect

    Browser->>CloudRun: GET /api/auth/github/callback?code=...<br/>HTTPS
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward with OAuth code
    Express->>GitHubOAuth: POST /login/oauth/access_token<br/>HTTPS/443, Client ID + Secret
    GitHubOAuth-->>Express: access_token, refresh_token
    Express-->>Browser: Redirect with token in URL hash fragment

    Note over Browser,GitHubAPI: Flow 3: Results Store Submission

    Browser->>CloudRun: POST /api/results<br/>HTTPS, X-Prism-Github-Token
    CloudRun->>Express: Forward with auth header
    Express->>GitHubAPI: GET /user<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer token
    GitHubAPI-->>Express: User profile (username, orgs)
    Express->>GCS: GET prism-iam/github-user-allowlist.txt<br/>HTTPS/443, ADC
    GCS-->>Express: User allowlist
    Express->>Express: Resolve role (admin/user/none)<br/>Org membership + allowlist check
    Express->>Express: Generate UUID, validate payload (Zod)
    Express->>GCS: PUT results/{runId}/...<br/>HTTPS/443, ADC Bearer token<br/>Set metadata: submission_state=staged
    GCS-->>Express: Upload confirmation
    Express-->>CloudRun: 201 Created with runId
    CloudRun-->>Browser: Submission acknowledged
